1
00:00:00,778 --> 00:00:03,948
(Beverley:)Now, how could you not tell me
you were in a relationship...

2
00:00:04,115 --> 00:00:06,405
(Beverley:)...with this lovely,
charming young woman?

3
00:00:06,575 --> 00:00:08,365
-Heh, heh. Thank you.
-You're welcome.

4
00:00:08,536 --> 00:00:13,916
(Beverley:)Is it because she's uneducated,
trapped in a menial service position?

5
00:00:14,083 --> 00:00:17,083
(Penny:)What the hell happened
to lovely and charming?

6
00:00:17,253 --> 00:00:20,923
(Leonard:)How come you didn't tell me that you
and Father were getting a divorce?

7
00:00:21,090 --> 00:00:23,170
(Leonard:)How come you didn't tell me
you had surgery?

8
00:00:23,342 --> 00:00:25,432
(Leonard:)How come you didn't tell me
my dog died?

9
00:00:25,594 --> 00:00:27,224
[EXHALES STUTTERING BREATHS]

10
00:00:27,930 --> 00:00:30,680
(Beverley:)What I hear you saying...

11
00:00:31,058 --> 00:00:34,808
(Beverley:)...is that you want a more intimate
mother-son relationship.

12
00:00:35,229 --> 00:00:36,939
(Sheldon:)I do.

13
00:00:46,282 --> 00:01:01,022
(Beverley(gives him an uncomfortable hug):)There. It's late. Now, go to bed.

